/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
507 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The plot shows the deviation from the average quality for each tile. The colours are on a cold to hot scale, with cold colours being positions where the quality was at or above the average for that base in the run, and hotter colours indicate that a tile had worse qualities than other tiles for that base. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
