/K [1]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In a normal random library you would expect to see a roughly normal distribution of GC content where the central peak corresponds to the overall GC content of the underlying genome.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
524 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
