530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It's not unusual to see a very low proportion of Ns appearing in a sequence, especially nearer the end of a sequence. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (However, if this proportion rises above a few percent it suggests that the analysis pipeline was unable to interpret the data well enough to make valid base calls.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
532 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The most common reason for the inclusion of significant proportions of Ns is a general loss of quality.)
