/E (L90:  Like L50, but it refers to the number of contigs needed to cover 90% of the total assembly length. It provides insight into how many contigs are needed to account for the bulk of the assembly.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
626 0 obj
<<
